{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"**Suggested board inquiries—not mandatory approval conditions:**\n\n- **Selection:** Why this exchange and lead market maker (LMM)? What alternatives were evaluated? Who selected the LMM, using which criteria? What fees, incentives, affiliations or conflicts could influence the recommendation?\n- **Relevant-market expertise:** What experience does the LMM have with comparable ETFs and their underlying markets? Can it price and hedge exposures across trading hours, market closures and stressed conditions? How will spreads, quoted depth and performance be monitored, and when could it be replaced?\n- **Capital and support:** What balance-sheet capacity, inventory appetite and creation/redemption relationships support trading? Who supplies launch capital, how much, on what terms, and when may it exit? Are commitments documented? What happens if support disappears?\n\n**Worth knowing:** Temporary market-maker seed facilitates launch and trading; it is not evidence of durable investor demand. Separately assess expected investor assets, their concentration and likely persistence."}}
